-- # Class: IExecActionType Description: An IExec action type is a grouping of characteristics unique to an action that executes a command-line operation on a Windows operating system. [based on https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/taskschd/nn-taskschd-iexecaction?redirectedfrom=MSDN]
--     * Slot: id
--     * Slot: execArguments Description: Specifies the arguments associated with the command-line operation launched by the action. See also: http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/windows/desktop/aa380715(v=vs.85).aspx.
